WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.847
Today your child reads sentences, and then a story. All made of the eight sounds.

2
00:00:05.297 --> 00:00:06.913
These are today's two pages.

3
00:00:07.363 --> 00:00:09.751
Old sounds first, as always. All eight.

4
00:00:11.919 --> 00:00:12.785
As in nest.

5
00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.017
As in moon.

6
00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:25.663
One new thing today. A sentence starts with a big letter, and this plan has not taught big letters.

7
00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:33.257
So the sentences here start with only two big letters. They look like the small ones, only bigger. Show your child once.

8
00:00:34.057 --> 00:00:39.936
There is also one tiny word made of one letter. Your child can say its sound. That is fine.

9
00:00:40.736 --> 00:00:47.876
Your child reads the first sentence to you. If a word is hard, point under each letter, and let your child say the sounds.

10
00:00:48.326 --> 00:00:52.905
Then step away. Your child writes the first sound of each of the eight pictures.

11
00:00:53.355 --> 00:00:58.120
Then turn to the story. This page is a stretch, so read it together if you need to.

12
00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:03.432
Do the final check tomorrow, not today. It is meant to show what has stayed overnight.
